{
  "sn44.11:0.1": "Linked Discourses 44.11 ",
  "sn44.11:0.2": "1. The Undeclared Points ",
  "sn44.11:0.3": "With Sabhiya Kaccāna ",
  "sn44.11:1.1": "At one time Venerable Sabhiya Kaccāna was staying at Ñātika in the brick house. ",
  "sn44.11:1.2": "Then the wanderer Vacchagotta went up to him, and exchanged greetings with him. ",
  "sn44.11:1.3": "When the greetings and polite conversation were over, he sat down to one side, and said to Sabhiya Kaccāna: ",
  "sn44.11:1.4": "“Worthy Kaccāna, does a realized one still exist after death?” ",
  "sn44.11:1.5": "“Vaccha, this has not been declared by the Buddha.” ",
  "sn44.11:1.6": "",
  "sn44.11:1.7": "“Well then, does a realized one no longer exist after death?” ",
  "sn44.11:1.8": "“This too has not been declared by the Buddha.” ",
  "sn44.11:1.9": "",
  "sn44.11:2.1": "“Well then, does a realized one both still exist and no longer exist after death?” ",
  "sn44.11:2.2": "“This has not been declared by the Buddha.” ",
  "sn44.11:2.3": "",
  "sn44.11:2.4": "“Well then, does a realized one neither still exist nor no longer exist after death?” ",
  "sn44.11:2.5": "“This too has not been declared by the Buddha.” ",
  "sn44.11:2.6": "",
  "sn44.11:3.1": "“Worthy Kaccāna, when asked these questions, you say that this has not been declared by the Buddha. ",
  "sn44.11:3.2": "",
  "sn44.11:3.3": "",
  "sn44.11:3.4": "",
  "sn44.11:3.5": "",
  "sn44.11:3.6": "",
  "sn44.11:3.7": "",
  "sn44.11:3.8": "",
  "sn44.11:3.9": "",
  